{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:scripts/live-connectors-smoke.ts",
    "title": "Lark 连接器实时读取冒烟验证",
    "summary": "从固定 Lark Wiki 地址执行真实读取，将结果交给统一 Capture 合同校验，并输出标题、上游版本、内容类型及文本规模；主要证明连接器可读且返回结构合法。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "问题与模块关系",
        "body": "该脚本验证 Lark 外部内容能否通过 `larkInput` 转成系统统一的捕获输入，而不是让后续存储或学习流程直接依赖 Lark 私有格式。返回值立即经过 `captureSchema.parse`，把连接器与 contracts 中的 Capture 数据边界连接起来；结构不合法时解析会抛错并使检查失败。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "flow",
        "title": "执行结果与覆盖边界",
        "body": "读取目标是代码中固定的 Lark Wiki URL。成功后脚本仅输出连接器名称、标题、上游版本、各 part 类型，以及所有文本 part 的字符总数，方便确认取得了可识别内容。[[c2]]\n\n它没有断言标题、版本、part 数量或文本字符数的最低值，所以一个结构合法但内容为空或目标内容意外变化的结果仍可能通过。它也未覆盖文件、Git 等其他连接器，更未进入 Store 捕获、修订生成或学习任务；网络可达性、Lark CLI 登录态和访问权限属于运行环境前提。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "Lark 输入与 Capture 合同校验",
        "reason": "支持真实连接器结果由统一 captureSchema 校验、非法结构会导致失败的论断。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:scripts/live-connectors-smoke.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 7
        },
        "quote": "import { larkInput } from \"../apps/server/src/connectors.js\";\nimport { captureSchema } from \"../packages/contracts/src/index.js\";\nconst input = captureSchema.parse(\n  await larkInput(\n    \"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/DwxIwD5RtiF5LFk2MNvc853znmc\",\n  ),\n);"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "连接器诊断摘要",
        "reason": "支持脚本输出标题、版本、part 类型和文本字符总数的流程说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:scripts/live-connectors-smoke.ts",
          "startLine": 8,
          "endLine": 22
        },
        "quote": "console.log(\n  JSON.stringify(\n    {\n      connector: \"lark-cli\",\n      title: input.title,\n      version: input.upstreamVersion,\n      partTypes: input.parts.map((p) => p.type),\n      textCharacters: input.parts.reduce(\n        (sum, p) => sum + (p.type === \"text\" ? p.text.length : 0),\n        0,\n      ),\n    },\n    n"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "固定 Wiki 读取流程",
        "reason": "支持目标地址固定且脚本没有额外内容断言的边界分析。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:scripts/live-connectors-smoke.ts",
          "startLine": 3,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "const input = captureSchema.parse(\n  await larkInput(\n    \"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/DwxIwD5RtiF5LFk2MNvc853znmc\",\n  ),\n);\nconsole.log(\n  JSON.stringify(\n    {\n      connector: \"lark-cli\",\n      title: input.title,\n      version: input.upstreamVersion,\n      partTypes: input.parts.map((p) => p.type),\n      "
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "该实时检查是否需要定义“有效内容”的最低断言，例如至少一个非空文本 part 和非空上游版本？",
        "why": "当前成功标准主要是 Capture Schema 可解析，无法区分完整读取与结构合法但内容不足的响应。",
        "nextStep": "结合 Lark 连接器合同确定稳定字段，再加入不依赖具体文档文案的非空和类型断言。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
